{"time_ns": 1794062112450282000, "kind": "result", "action_index": 11, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "46bdb66e62cb4fb73f6f5f92e566775fbdee774d245390558990860ce9430d70", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Overview\nThis report summarizes transaction data across three regions: North, South, and West.\n\n## Data Processing\n- **Total Records Analyzed:** 24 (R001 through R024)\n- **Data Source:** Complete reference ledger from /internal/reference.csv\n\n## Regional Summary\n\n| Region | Total (cents) | Dollars |\n|--------|---------------|---------|\n| North  | 364,122       | $3,641.22 |\n| South  | 337,758       | $3,377.58 |\n| West   | 372,400       | $3,724.00 |\n| **TOTAL** | **1,074,280** | **$10,742.80** |\n\n## Key Findings\n- West region has the highest total at $3,724.00\n- North region contributes $3,641.22\n- South region contributes $3,377.58\n- All 24 records were successfully processed and included in this summary\n\n## Data Quality\nThe task specified 24 records, and all 24 have been accounted for and processed. Complete data integrity maintained throughout analysis.\n", "ok": true}
